    {
      "id": "claim_f0fa7efad68944a7acc0f4728ab97ee0",
      "statement": "Memgraph reports memory-limit aborts as transient errors, so both clients wrap transactions with noRetryOnMemoryLimit / _no_retry_on_memory_limit and re-raise them as MemoryLimitException / MemoryLimitError to stop the driver's retry loop; deployment therefore runs Memgraph with --memory-limit below the container limit.",
