    {
      "id": "claim_c542e9065db644d8b9316c3bc896437b",
      "statement": "The Python RunRecorder creates a running Run with its USED edges, completes/fails it with token usage and timestamps, and cleanup_stale deletes facts produced by non-completed runs with a given inputKey (marking those runs failed), so aborted runs leave no visible facts.",
