      "statement": "contracts/kg/init.cypher declares unique id constraints for Project, Ingestion, Artifact, ArtifactVersion, Element, Concept, TraceLink, Inconsistency, and Run plus single-property indexes (Element(key), Inconsistency(fingerprint), Run(inputKey), projectId etc.); it is idempotent and applied by the extraction-agent at startup.",
